    "title": "Teenager arrested in connection to deadly Driver's License Branch shooting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Derek Brightwell ,\n2 hours ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. (WAVE) - An arrest has been made in connection to a shooting at a Driver’s License Branch in Valley Station that killed three in February 2025. The shooting happened around noon on Feb. 21 at the branch on Willismore Drive. One man died at the scene. Two women were taken to UofL Hospital where they also died. Read full article\n3",
